{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.725 (F1: 0.685), slightly higher than the concat fusion baseline (0.721). The result suggests weighted fusion may offer marginal gains, but the exact contribution of the fusion method remains uncertain due to potential interactions with other design choices. Further experiments are needed to isolate its impact compared to alternative strategies."
}

